  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p>You can start a dance as part of making a charge, and dancers can join your dance as part of making a charge (including charging through your dance radius). Whenever a dancer would make a charge, all other dancers do not count as an obstruction when determining the path of which the dancer could move through successfully; instead, the charging dancer can change direction up to 90 degrees during their charge whenever they would charge through another dancer’s square. If the attack made at the end of the charge is successful, the dancer may make a free bull rush attempt against the target, using the result of the original attack roll as your combat maneuver check, although gaining a bonus equal to the number of dancer’s within this dance.</p>\n<p>If a dancer joins your dance as part of making a charge, they retain the benefits of your dance for 1 round after they leave the area.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc33\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
